# Netlify _redirects — Óptica Anaka
# Format: <source> <destination> <status>
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── WordPress legacy query params ──
# Netlify syntax: <from> <query-condition> <to> <status>
# `301!` forces the redirect even when the destination (/) already returns 200.
/*  page_id=:id     /  301!
/*  pid=:id         /  301!
/*  p=:id           /  301!
/*  feed=:type      /  301!
/*  replytocom=:id  /  301!
/index.php  pid=:id  /  301!
/index.php           /  301!

